<item><hi rendition="#aq">B.</hi> <hi rendition="#g">Litterari&#x017F;che</hi>. §. 35. <ref>17.</ref></item><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <item><hi rendition="#c">Ge&#x017F;chichte der Kun&#x017F;t im Alterthum.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Die Griechen.<lb/>
